    "group": "Cursed Legion",
    "summary": "Weapons carried by DESTROYER CULT models in your army get +2 Strength. Also, the first time in a turn that attacks by one of your DESTROYER CULT units wipe out a unit or reduce it to Below Half-strength, once the attacking unit has resolved all of its attacks, weapons carried by your NECRONS models get +2 Strength until the turn ends. MONSTER, TITANIC and DESTROYER CULT models do not gain that second bonus.",
